// Static mesh — no ALE motion.
//
// The fluid mesh never deforms. Solid deformations are < 10 µm on a ~18 mm
// domain (< 0.06 %), so the feedback of structural motion on IOP is negligible.
// The preCICE coupling is serial-explicit Force-only: fluid sends Force to
// solid, solid computes D. No Displacement feedback to the fluid.

dynamicFvMesh   staticFvMesh;
